#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:54
msgid ""
"Your identity on this mesh — the device name shown to other peers and the "
"network you're connected to."
msgstr ""
"Din identitet i dette nettet — enhetsnavnet som vises for andre noder, og "
"nettverket du er tilkoblet."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:71
msgid "Rename this device on the network"
msgstr "Gi nytt navn til denne enheten i nettverket"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:86
msgid ""
"Manual setup — expand to paste a server URL and pre-auth key when you "
"already received them from your administrator. Most users should sign in "
"through the panel button above instead."
msgstr ""
"Manuelt oppsett — utvid for å lime inn en server-URL og "
"forhåndsgodkjenningsnøkkel når du allerede har mottatt dem fra "
"administratoren. De fleste brukere bør logge på via panelknappen ovenfor i "
"stedet."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:99
msgid ""
"Address of the coordination server (e.g. vpn.example.org). The https:// "
"scheme is added automatically if you omit it."
msgstr ""
"Adresse til koordineringsserveren (f.eks. vpn.example.org). Skjemaet "
"https:// legges til automatisk hvis du utelater det."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:111
msgid ""
"One-time or reusable key created on the server (starts with 'hskey-auth-'). "
"Used to register this device automatically without opening a browser."
msgstr ""
"Engangs- eller gjenbrukbar nøkkel opprettet på serveren (starter med 'hskey-"
"auth-'). Brukes til å registrere denne enheten automatisk uten å åpne en "
"nettleser."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:190
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:418
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:124
msgid "Device name on the network"
msgstr "Enhetsnavn i nettverket"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:127
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN — this is the Tailscale"
" hostname, NOT your computer's name and NOT your user. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'."
msgstr ""
"Navnet denne enheten viser for andre noder i VPN-en — dette er Tailscale-"
"vertsnavnet, IKKE datamaskinens navn og IKKE brukeren din. Små bokstaver, "
"sifre og bindestreker. Eksempel: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:144
msgid ""
"Persist the server, key and device name above. Won't connect — press Connect"
" afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Lagre serveren, nøkkelen og enhetsnavnet ovenfor. Vil ikke koble til — trykk"
" Koble til etterpå."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:163
msgid ""
"When on, BigLace runs 'tailscale up' as soon as it launches, so you join the"
" mesh without clicking Connect every time."
msgstr ""
"Når på, kjører BigLace 'tailscale up' så snart den starter, slik at du blir "
"med i nettet uten å klikke Koble til hver gang."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:171
msgid "Toggle auto-connect on startup"
msgstr "Slå på/av automatisk tilkobling ved oppstart"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:201
msgid ""
"If the tunnel drops (network change, sleep, server hiccup), BigLace silently"
" retries with growing delays instead of leaving you offline until you "
"notice."
msgstr ""
"Hvis tunnelen faller (nettverksendring, dvale, serverfeil), prøver BigLace "
"stille på nytt med økende forsinkelser i stedet for å la deg være frakoblet "
"til du oppdager det."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:210
msgid "Toggle auto-reconnect"
msgstr "Slå på/av automatisk gjenoppkobling"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:221
msgid ""
"Send a desktop toast when another device on your network goes online or "
"offline. Rapid bursts are coalesced into a single notification so you don't "
"get spammed during reconnects."
msgstr ""
"Send et skrivebordsvarsel når en annen enhet i nettverket ditt blir online "
"eller offline. Raske utbrudd samles til ett enkelt varsel slik at du ikke "
"blir oversvømmet under gjenoppkoblinger."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:230
msgid "Toggle peer-change notifications"
msgstr "Slå på/av varsler om nodeendringer"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:245
msgid ""
"Join or leave the mesh network. When connected, this device becomes "
"reachable by the other peers in your account."
msgstr ""
"Bli med i eller forlat maskenettverket. Når du er tilkoblet, blir denne "
"enheten tilgjengelig for de andre peerene i kontoen din."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:177
msgid ""
"Address of your BigScale panel (e.g. panel.example.org). The https:// scheme"
" is added automatically if you omit it."
msgstr ""
"Adressen til BigScale-panelet ditt (f.eks. panel.example.org). "
"https://-skjemaet legges til automatisk hvis du utelater det."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:182
msgid "Your panel username — the one you use to sign in to the web panel."
msgstr ""
"Panelbrukernavnet ditt — det du bruker for å logge inn på nettpanelet."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:186
msgid ""
"Your panel password. Stored in the OS keyring (libsecret on Linux, Keychain "
"on macOS, Credential Manager on Windows)."
msgstr ""
"Panelpassordet ditt. Lagres i operativsystemets nøkkelring (libsecret på "
"Linux, Keychain på macOS, Credential Manager på Windows)."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:193
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN — this is the Tailscale"
" hostname, NOT your computer's name and NOT your user. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'. Pick "
"something other peers will recognise."
msgstr ""
"Navnet denne enheten viser til andre peere på VPN-en — dette er Tailscale-"
"vertsnavnet, IKKE datamaskinens navn og IKKE brukeren din. Små bokstaver, "
"sifre og bindestreker. Eksempel: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'. "
"Velg noe andre peere vil kjenne igjen."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:442
msgid "Rename this device"
msgstr "Gi nytt navn til denne enheten"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:444
msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: tales-laptop."
msgstr ""
"Navnet denne enheten viser til andre peere på VPN-en. Små bokstaver, sifre "
"og bindestreker. Eksempel: tales-laptop."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:449
msgid "Save & apply"
msgstr "Lagre og bruk"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:502
msgid "Saved. The new name will take effect the next time you connect."
msgstr "Lagret. Det nye navnet trer i kraft neste gang du kobler til."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:526
msgid "Device renamed."
msgstr "Enheten har fått nytt navn."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:536
#, rust-format
msgid "Rename failed: {error}"
msgstr "Omdøping mislyktes: {error}"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:553
msgid "The device name can't be empty."
msgstr "Enhetsnavnet kan ikke være tomt."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:556
msgid "Use 63 characters or fewer."
msgstr "Bruk 63 tegn eller færre."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:560
msgid "The device name can't start or end with a hyphen."
msgstr "Enhetsnavnet kan ikke starte eller slutte med en bindestrek."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/dialogs.rs:564
msgid "Only lowercase letters, digits and hyphens are allowed."
msgstr "Bare små bokstaver, sifre og bindestreker er tillatt."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/peer_row.rs:306
msgid "SSH login (override)"
msgstr "SSH-pålogging (overstyr)"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/peer_row.rs:336
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Lagret"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1086
msgid "(no device name)"
msgstr "(ingen enhetsnavn)"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1400
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} devices are online"
msgstr "{count} enheter er online"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1401
#, rust-format
msgid "{count} devices went offline"
msgstr "{count} enheter ble offline"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:1403
#, rust-format
msgid "{on_count} online · {off_count} offline"
msgstr "{on_count} online · {off_count} offline"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/tailscale.rs:650
#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:814
msgid "Enter the server URL before connecting."
msgstr "Skriv inn server-URL-en før du kobler til."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:682
msgid "Enter the server URL before saving."
msgstr "Skriv inn server-URL-en før du lagrer."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/mod.rs:691
msgid "Enter the pre-auth key before saving."
msgstr "Skriv inn forhåndsgodkjenningsnøkkelen før du lagrer."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:178
msgid "Start BigLace with the session"
msgstr "Start BigLace med økten"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:179
msgid "Open BigLace after you sign in to the desktop"
msgstr "Åpne BigLace etter at du har logget på skrivebordet"

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:182
msgid ""
"Turn this on to add BigLace to your desktop session startup. Turn it off to "
"remove it."
msgstr ""
"Slå på dette for å legge til BigLace i oppstarten av skrivebordsøkten. Slå "
"det av for å fjerne det."

#: /home/talesam/Servidor/GitHub/BigCommunity/biglace/src/window/sidebar.rs:190
msgid "Toggle start with session"
msgstr "Veksle start med økt"

